        "title": {
          "en": "Organizations Report Readiness Gap in AI Agent Adoption",
          "zh": "组织报告AI智能体采纳存在准备度差距"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "Despite high ambition for AI agent adoption, most organizations report a lack of readiness in current operations and infrastructure.",
          "zh": "尽管对AI智能体采纳雄心勃勃，但大多数组织表示其当前运营和基础设施尚未做好准备。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "85% of organizations aim for agentic operations within three years.",
            "76% of organizations state their existing operations and infrastructure are insufficient for this change.",
            "Readiness deficiencies are observed across organizational people, processes, and workflows."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "85%的组织计划在未来三年内实现智能体化运营。",
            "76%的组织表示其现有运营和基础设施无法支持这一变革。",
            "组织在人员、流程和工作流程方面普遍缺乏准备。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This disconnect between ambition and operational readiness indicates a significant challenge for the widespread implementation of enterprise-level AI agents, potentially slowing adoption and necessitating strategic adjustments in organizational design.",
          "zh": "这种雄心与运营准备度之间的脱节表明企业级AI智能体广泛实施面临重大挑战，可能减缓采纳速度，并要求组织设计进行战略调整。"
        },
        "source": "MIT Tech Review (AI)",
        "link": "https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/05/26/1137584/rethinking-organizational-design-in-the-age-of-agentic-ai/"
      },
