        "title": {
          "en": "LLMs Refine Themselves Without External Guidance",
          "zh": "大型语言模型无需外部指导即可自我精炼"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "Researchers proposed Self-Verified Distillation, an algorithm enabling post-trained large language models to improve using only unlabeled prompts across math, science, and coding domains, without external teachers or tools.",
          "zh": "研究人员提出了一种名为“自验证蒸馏”的算法，使经过后训练的大型语言模型能够在数学、科学和编程领域，仅使用未标记的提示进行自我改进，无需外部教师或工具。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "The Self-Verified Distillation algorithm facilitates post-training refinement for LLMs.",
            "It operates exclusively with unlabeled seed questions, removing the need for external teachers or tools.",
            "The method's efficacy has been explored across three distinct reasoning domains: math, science, and coding."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "“自验证蒸馏”算法促进了大型语言模型的后训练精炼。",
            "该方法仅使用未标记的种子问题运行，消除了对外部教师或工具的需求。",
            "该方法的有效性已在三个不同的推理领域进行探索：数学、科学和编码。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This approach offers a pathway for LLM improvement that reduces reliance on human-labeled data and external feedback, potentially lowering development costs and accelerating model evolution in specific reasoning tasks.",
          "zh": "这种方法为LLM的改进提供了一条新途径，减少了对人工标注数据和外部反馈的依赖，可能降低开发成本并加速模型在特定推理任务中的演进。"
        },
        "source": "arXiv CS.CL",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.26132"
      }
